===Speak with Guangda{{subst:void|<!--202090101-->}}===
{{Mission Description|type=adventure|location=Exalting Sanctum|The duties of the Realm-Keeping Commission's orderlies are like bricks, to be moved wherever they are needed. The work of Guangda is not an easy one, and now he is worrying in front of the Realm-Keeping Commission chancery...<br />Out of goodwill, you can ask him if he needs help, but whether you will help is a different matter...}}
{{Dialogue Start}}

;(Talk to Guangda)
;(First interaction)
::'''Guangda:''' Ah, two centuries passed, and then two centuries more... If I don't get my promotion, I'll undergo my hatching rebirth soon...
::{{Диалог|Стрелка}} Promotion?
:::'''Guangda:''' Yeah. In one of our lifetimes, Vidyadhara have to serve as officers or clerks so we get a taste of what it's like to be a public servant, right?
::{{Диалог|Стрелка}} That's a real shame.
:::'''Guangda:''' Sure is. Unfortunately, we're the only ones who think it's a real shame. If only management felt the same way.
::{{Диалог|Стрелка}} In your next life, go all out.
:::'''Guangda:''' Haha, I'm afraid that I'll be a lowly orderly in my next life. I've started to wonder how exactly things ended up during my previous life.
::'''Guangda:''' Hey, that's enough for now. Let's not linger on such a morose topic.
::'''Guangda:''' I'm Guangda, a lowly orderly from the Realm-Keeping Commission. If you have any issues to handle, I suggest you visit our Chancery offices...
;(Subsequent interactions)
::'''Guangda:''' Please head inside the Chancery office for any official business. I'm just a lowly orderly...
;(If )
:{{Диалог|undefined}} Are you having trouble with something?
::'''Guangda:''' When you're working in the Realm-Keeping Commission, every day is trouble.
::'''Guangda:''' Seriously, sometimes I have a feeling that the Realm-Keeping Commission doesn't have a respectable social status at all. It is responsible for all the dirtiest, most tedious work.
::'''Guangda:''' Official Dahao told me that someone had been putting up advertising posters in the Exalting Sanctum, and he wanted me to remove them.
::'''Guangda:''' You get it? He asked me to remove the posters.
::{{Диалог|Стрелка}} Yes, I can hear you clearly.
:::'''Guangda:''' You don't get it. The job is so meaningless! Is that within the job description of an orderly?
::{{Диалог|Стрелка}} How can there still be such uncivilized people in Luofu?
:::'''Guangda:''' Exactly! That point aside, do you think removing posters is my duty?
::'''Guangda:''' Come to think of it, it really does seem to be my job!
::'''Guangda:''' How about I pay you, and you help me remove the posters, especially the ones that are particularly eye-catching? I remember there are some Lost and Found notices. Please remove them all.
::{{Диалог|Стрелка}} Do I hand the posters over to you after removing them?
:::'''Guangda:''' Oh, please don't. Just throw them away when no one's looking. I don't need the posters to report on my work.
:::'''Guangda:''' It'll be a kind deed if you can find the lost item for the owner.
::{{Диалог|Стрелка}} These peanuts are not enough to hire me!
:::'''Guangda:''' What I pay is more than enough, seeing you're only removing the Lost and Found notices.
:::'''Guangda:''' You'll get more rewards if you can find the lost item for the owner.
::'''Guangda:''' Take your pay and start searching.
;(If {{Mission|Wood Sprouts Anew, Fate Tilts Askew|showChapter=0}} has been completed, {{cx}}<!--performance 502025301 has been seen-->, and {{Mission|Obsequies Performed, A Long Road Ahead|showChapter=0}} has not been completed)
:{{Диалог|Разговор}} Did you notice the Ambrosial Arbor was growing once again?
::'''Guangda:''' How could I miss it!
::'''Guangda:''' Drop it. The Seat of Divine Foresight put out a mandate demanding that we stand on strict guard duty during this sensitive period of regrowth. We absolutely cannot afford any secondary problems to occur.
::'''Guangda:''' *sigh* Please don't let there be another accident. Please don't let there be another accident... If anything else happens, they'll take my pension away.
::'''Guangda:''' ...Or at least, please don't let there be any accidents in my jurisdiction...
;(If {{Mission|Obsequies Performed, A Long Road Ahead|showChapter=0}} has been completed and {{Mission|Wood Sprouts Anew, Fate Tilts Askew|showChapter=0}} has been completed, {{cx}}<!--performance 502025301 has been seen-->, and {{Mission|Obsequies Performed, A Long Road Ahead|showChapter=0}} has not been completed)
:{{Диалог|Разговор}} Do you know that the Ambrosial Arbor no longer sprouts?
::'''Guangda:''' You bet. A couple of days ago, we were asked to appease the public alongside the Cloud Knights.
::'''Guangda:''' It is tiring, but it's worth it... After working so hard to protect the peace, we can finally loosen up a bit.
::'''Guangda:''' I can really use a break, and I already have plans in my mind for what I want to do during the vacation... I'll spend a few days going on a trip and enjoying good food... just the thought of it puts me in a good mood.
;(If {{Mission|Obsequies Performed, A Long Road Ahead|showChapter=0}} has been completed and {{Mission|Wood Sprouts Anew, Fate Tilts Askew|showChapter=0}} has been completed, {{cx}}<!--performance 502025301 has been seen-->, and {{Mission|Obsequies Performed, A Long Road Ahead|showChapter=0}} has not been completed)
:{{Диалог}} I want to chat with you...
::'''Guangda:''' As long as we don't talk about work, I'll chat about anything.
::{{Диалог|Разговор}} Do you really work here at the Realm-Keeping Commission?
:::'''Guangda:''' Haha, is it that obvious?
:::'''Guangda:''' Actually, I'm one of the armed guards at the Realm-Keeping Commission. There's usually nothing much to do, so I just stand by the door and keep watch.
:::{{Диалог|Стрелка}} Didn't you just say that you were an orderly, though?
::::'''Guangda:''' Yeah, I thought you'd already forgotten. Haha!
:::{{Диалог|Стрелка}} Where's your weapon, then?
::::'''Guangda:''' No.
:::'''Guangda:''' So... the Realm-Keeping Commission doesn't actually have any armed guards, and I'm just a lowly orderly after all.
:::{{Диалог|Стрелка}} Shame.
::::'''Guangda:''' I think so too, a real shame.
::::'''Guangda:''' If you ever get the chance to give us a rating, please can you make this suggestion? That the Realm-Keeping Commission should have some armed guards. Thanks a lot!
:::;(Return to previous option selection)
:::{{Диалог|Стрелка}} What do orderlies do, then?
::::'''Guangda:''' Hahaha, so you're really interested in that, huh? ...Alright, I'll tell you.
::::'''Guangda:''' It's really simple, actually. Diplomatically, we say we carry out executive orders. But really, it's just a bunch of menial tasks. We slog through chores, run errands, and get paid the lowest rank of wages...
::::'''Guangda:''' Do you know this old Xianzhou saying? "Starskiffs need to fly high, but not burn energy"...
::::'''Guangda:''' ...This saying sums up the life of us orderlies at the Realm-Keeping Commission.
:::;(Return to previous option selection)
::{{Диалог|Разговор}} What sort of place is the Realm-Keeping Commission?
:::'''Guangda:''' Oh, that's a great question. Let me think...
:::'''Guangda:''' On the surface, we're the department that handles general affairs aboard the Xianzhou. The census, resource allocation, environmental protections, time calibration... We get up to all of these kinds of things.
:::{{Диалог|Стрелка}} Sounds pretty incredible.
::::'''Guangda:''' To be blunt, it's just a bunch of everyday chores like listening to daily problems, allocating food stocks, cleaning up after people, and notifying the public about the time.
::::'''Guangda:''' It sounds really lofty and amazing, but...
::::'''Guangda:''' Take for example our Chancery. It deals with all kinds of difficult details that people run into in their everyday lives.
::::'''Guangda:''' It could be as small as the city's appearance, right up to a large civil lawsuit... If you can think of anything that the government should be doing, then come to us.
::::'''Guangda:''' But I should personally advise you to try solving things first yourself... After all, once all the tasks have been allocated, it's always a lowly orderly like me who has to suffer.
:::;(Return to previous option selection)
:::{{Диалог|Стрелка}} So what do you actually get up to on the sly, then?
::::'''Guangda:''' Hold on! I was just about to tell you.
::::'''Guangda:''' Take for example our Chancery. It deals with all kinds of difficult details that people run into in their everyday lives.
::::'''Guangda:''' It could be as small as the city's appearance, right up to a large civil lawsuit... If you can think of anything that the government should be doing, then come to us.
::::'''Guangda:''' But I should personally advise you to try solving things first yourself... After all, once all the tasks have been allocated, it's always a lowly orderly like me who has to suffer.
:::;(Return to previous option selection)
:::{{Диалог|Стрелка}} I know! More chores, right?
::::'''Guangda:''' Amazing, you've hit the nail on the head! Have you considered applying for the Divination Commission? They should get paid better than we do.
::::'''Guangda:''' Haha, just kidding. Let me continue telling you what we get up to &mdash; after all, that's also part of our job...
::::'''Guangda:''' Take for example our Chancery. It deals with all kinds of difficult details that people run into in their everyday lives.
::::'''Guangda:''' It could be as small as the city's appearance, right up to a large civil lawsuit... If you can think of anything that the government should be doing, then come to us.
::::'''Guangda:''' But I should personally advise you to try solving things first yourself... After all, once all the tasks have been allocated, it's always a lowly orderly like me who has to suffer.
:::;(Return to previous option selection)
::{{Диалог|Выход}} Nice chat.
:::'''Guangda:''' Take care. I'd better get back to it...
;(If {{Mission|Obsequies Performed, A Long Road Ahead|showChapter=0}} has been completed and {{Mission|Wood Sprouts Anew, Fate Tilts Askew|showChapter=0}} has been completed, {{cx}}<!--performance 502025301 has been seen-->, and {{Mission|Obsequies Performed, A Long Road Ahead|showChapter=0}} has not been completed)
:{{Диалог|Выход}} I'm heading off, then.
::'''Guangda:''' Take care. I'd better get back to it...

;(Obtain {{Предмет|Lost and Found Notice|20|x=1}})
{{Dialogue End}}

===Take a stroll in the Exalting Sanctum and take down the small advertisements{{subst:void|<!--202090138-->}}===
{{Mission Description|type=adventure|location=Exalting Sanctum|update|The duties of the Realm-Keeping Commission often involve trivial things, and taking down small advertisements will not be the last of them. Since you accepted Guangda's milk tea, help him out with this task.<br />Sometimes, even an outworlder like you can't help but wonder, is the Realm-Keeping Commission really a commission?}}
{{Dialogue Start}}
{{Dialogue End}}

===Follow the lost and found notice and find the owner, Cong{{subst:void|<!--202090102-->}}===
{{Mission Description|type=adventure|location=Exalting Sanctum|update|According to the lost-and-found notice, the owner is "Cong, craftsman of the Artisanship Commission." Maybe you should ask him what happened.<br />The words "Big Reward" is written on the lost-and-found notice. For one who is brimming with the spirit of exploration such as yourself, you have to see what this big reward is, right?<br />Of course, the most important thing is that you have a willing heart to help others.}}
{{Dialogue Start}}

;(Lose {{Предмет|Lost and Found Notice|20|x=1}})

;(Talk to Ruoyue)
;(First interaction)
::'''Ruoyue:''' Ah, an esteemed customer visiting Xianzhou from afar. Are you here for a divination today?
::'''Ruoyue:''' Since it's your first time here, allow me to introduce myself. I am the genius diviner, formerly of the Divination Commission, now a humble shopkeeper of the Looking Bronze. My name is Ruoyue.
::'''Ruoyue:''' Whether you're seeking fortune or safety, or simply wish to check your horoscope, to find love, or even to request a name for a child, I am humbly at your service.
::{{Диалог|Стрелка}} I wish to name myself.
:::'''Ruoyue:''' Oh, seeking a name for yourself? That is a rare request indeed.
:::'''Ruoyue:''' Looking at you, and with a pinch of my fingers, and I've got the perfect name for you.
:::'''Ruoyue:''' How about "Noob"?
:::{{Диалог|Стрелка}} That's worse than (Trailblazer).
::::'''Ruoyue:''' That sounds just fine. Your name is fine as it is. I see no need to change it.
:::{{Диалог|Стрелка}} That IS my name.
::::'''Ruoyue:''' I wouldn't have known that one with such elegant flair as yours would have such a resounding name.
::::'''Ruoyue:''' You may not be aware, but a name is the shortest form of a spell. If you're ever in peril, just yell out your name "Noob," and it will surely be useful to you.
:::{{Диалог|Стрелка}} You don't think your naming lacks a little sophistication?
::::'''Ruoyue:''' Noob Noob, never want for gulp or slurp. Noob Noob, Luofu's friend, always a perk.
::::'''Ruoyue:''' If you don't like that, how about a fee to unlock "Sophisticated Names" and "Seriously Sophisticated Names"... I have services for all needs.
::{{Диалог|Стрелка}} I wish to know my fortune.
:::'''Ruoyue:''' You've come to the right person. This is our shop special, the "Fortune for Today." The first try's free. Let me see...
:::'''Ruoyue:''' Oh dear, this scene paints the destruction of the Xianzhou Cangcheng: "Fighting fire with woods will only fuel the flames." Your recent affairs haven't been going your way, so instead of remedying them, you should leave them be.
:::'''Ruoyue:''' We provide fortune-changing services, like the "Evil Begone" bundle for 199, "See No Evil" bundle for 299, and the "Only Good Things From Here On Out" bundle for 599. All great value! What do you think?
:::{{Диалог|Стрелка}} It feels like you didn't really think those bundles' names through.
::::'''Ruoyue:''' Those names are of no importance. The prices speak for themselves!
::::'''Ruoyue:''' Names are just superficial packaging. They can change anytime.
:::{{Диалог|Стрелка}} Did you make me pick a dire fortune on purpose?
::::'''Ruoyue:''' Oh, you hurt me with your words. If you don't believe me, let's try another one. Look, it's still the same: "Like birds into nets, when will reunion be, one frets".
:::{{Диалог|Стрелка}} I can change my luck just like that?
::::'''Ruoyue:''' Your luck isn't something set in stone. If everything was already pre-determined, where would one's freedom be?
::'''Ruoyue:''' You are our lucky 100th customer for the day, so I'll give you an "Evil Begone" bundle as a favor. This is your "lucky trinket" for today. Don't lose it now.
::'''Ruoyue:''' Do you have anything else you need help with?
;(Subsequent interactions)
::'''Ruoyue:''' Oh, you're back again? Hold on, I'm reading a book called "A Prophecy's Self-fulfillment."
::'''Ruoyue:''' Well, that was boring. It's much more interesting to talk to you. Are you here to determine your luck, or just to chat?
::'''Ruoyue:''' Whether you're seeking fortune or safety, or simply wish to check your horoscope, to find love, or even to request a name for a child, I am humbly at your service.
;(If )
:{{Диалог|?}} Have you heard of the jinxed A-Xing?
::'''Ruoyue:''' A-Xing? Well, I may not remember the name along, but since you mentioned "jinxed," I can hardly forget someone as unlucky as him... I mean, he has never drawn a "Weal" stick, but he just keeps on trying anyway.
::'''Ruoyue:''' It's his bad luck that makes him draw a "Woe" stick every time, not the other way around. Of course, I've recommended him a lot of charms and trinkets to help improve his luck, but his bad luck is a bit too... overwhelming.
::'''Ruoyue:''' To be honest... I've always believed that one's fate is not necessarily predestined. If one can stay optimistic about their future, then they will have a brighter future ahead of them.
::'''Ruoyue:''' If A-Xing could experience something other than "Woe," it might help change his attitude about his fate... Unfortunately, he's never had the chance...
::{{Диалог|Стрелка}} How about we guarantee him a "Weal"?
::'''Ruoyue:''' Huh? Are you suggesting... that I rig the results so that A-Xing gets a "Weal"? But that's just a fake result. It's not really going to change his bad luck...
::{{Диалог|Стрелка}} You just said that one's fate is not necessarily predestined.
:::'''Ruoyue:''' Well... I guess that's a good point.
::{{Диалог|Стрелка}} As long as this helps change his attitude about his fate.
:::'''Ruoyue:''' Well... I guess that's a good point.
::{{Диалог|Стрелка}} He said this would be the last draw of his life...
:::'''Ruoyue:''' I'm sort of convinced, I guess.
::'''Ruoyue:''' All right, fine! Just don't blame me or yourself if we guarantee him a "Weal" stick but he still has bad luck!
::'''Ruoyue:''' Wait for a while. I'll need to modify the jade abacus for divination.
::{{Black Screen|Ruoyue starts to modify her jade abacus used for divination. It doesn't take her too long to alter the hardware, since she used to be a diviner in the Divination Commission.}}
::'''Ruoyue:''' All right, it's done. Would you like to test it out? Theoretically, this jade abacus should only produce "Weal" results now.
::{{Диалог|Стрелка}} (Divine your fate)
::You dive into the depths of your mind and meditate on the question in your mind.
:;(Screen fades to black)
::As the jade abacus starts spinning, some kind of invisible barrier separates you from the outside world. In the midst of the sudden tranquility, a blurred yet unmistakable image gradually becomes clear...
::You are seeing the Xianzhou Luofu, on which the towering Ambrosial Arbor looms over countless Cloud Knights. With the arrival of numerous Outworlders, Starskiff Haven is alive with people from all walks of life.
::'''Ruoyue:''' It's the "Luofu," a very auspicious stick! Awesome, let's try again!
::{{Диалог|Стрелка}} But I thought you should never perform two divinations in a single day?
:::'''Ruoyue:''' Come on! Why even bother with these rules when we've already cracked the jade abacus?
::;(Screen fades to black)
:::As the jade abacus starts spinning, some kind of invisible barrier separates you from the outside world. In the midst of the sudden tranquility, a blurred yet unmistakable image gradually becomes clear...
:::You are seeing the Xianzhou Yaoqing, which is advancing at a dazzling speed, carrying the momentum of tempest and thunder. Countless foxians, fully armed, are standing on the deck in a majestic posture.
:::'''Ruoyue:''' Awesome, another "Weal" stick! Hah, even though it's been a while since I've tinkered with hardware like this, my skills haven't gone to waste after all...
:::'''Ruoyue:''' Now, please call A-Xing over.
:::{{Диалог|Стрелка}} Why do you need me to call him?
:::'''Ruoyue:''' Well... it might seem a bit too deliberate if I just call him out of the blue and say something like, "Hey, my jade abacus is ready. Come over here and draw your lot." It might make it seem like my abacus wasn't ready before.
:::'''Ruoyue:''' Just call him over and pretend you know nothing about my jade abacus. We've got to put on a credible show, otherwise we won't be able to help him.
:{{Диалог}} I wish to know my fortune.
:;(If {{cx}}<!--Hidden Mission ID 4040256--> has been started)
