:;(If {{cx}}<!--Hidden Mission ID 4040256--> has not been started)
:::'''Ruoyue:''' I have already divined for you today. Please come back tomorrow.
;(If {{Mission|Wood Sprouts Anew, Fate Tilts Askew|showChapter=0}} has been completed, {{cx}}<!--performance 502013201 has been seen-->, and {{Mission|Obsequies Performed, A Long Road Ahead|showChapter=0}} has not been completed)
:{{Диалог|Разговор}} The Ambrosial Arbor is growing again...
::'''Ruoyue:''' Tsk, that can't be a good omen.
::'''Ruoyue:''' The Luofu has been ravaged by disaster recently. Everyone thinks that the Cloud Knights are capable of solving every problem under the sun, no matter how great or small.
::'''Ruoyue:''' But the Ambrosial Arbor's growth doesn't fall within the scope of operations for the Cloud Knights...
::'''Ruoyue:''' I'm not sure if the master diviner has foreseen this? I'm thinking, probably not.
;(If {{Mission|Obsequies Performed, A Long Road Ahead|showChapter=0}} has been completed and {{Mission|Wood Sprouts Anew, Fate Tilts Askew|showChapter=0}} has been completed, {{cx}}<!--performance 502013201 has been seen-->, and {{Mission|Obsequies Performed, A Long Road Ahead|showChapter=0}} has not been completed)
:{{Диалог|Разговор}} Have you divined for the Ambrosial Arbor crisis?
::'''Ruoyue:''' I divined when it sprouted, but I didn't bother to check again later because I didn't think it was necessary. Neither its sprouting or its sudden stop came as a surprise to me.
::'''Ruoyue:''' It's just like... like each sign consists of yin and yang. If the Ambrosial Arbor suddenly sprouts, then it's destined to stop just as suddenly.. This result is bound to happen.
::'''Ruoyue:''' As for the impact, I'm not an official, and I don't think it's my job to worry about it. That's what the master diviner is for, right? For me, I'm more interested in figuring out what I'm going to eat for dinner.
;(If {{Mission|Obsequies Performed, A Long Road Ahead|showChapter=0}} has been completed and {{Mission|Wood Sprouts Anew, Fate Tilts Askew|showChapter=0}} has been completed, {{cx}}<!--performance 502013201 has been seen-->, and {{Mission|Obsequies Performed, A Long Road Ahead|showChapter=0}} has not been completed)
:{{Диалог}} I'd like to ask you a few things...
::'''Ruoyue:''' Fire away. But I'll have to start charging if it's to do with your fortune.
::{{Диалог|Разговор}} You said you were once a Divination Commission diviner?
:::'''Ruoyue:''' So, you have doubts about my professional proficiency. No fear, I worked there for almost two centuries, until I was personally ejected by Master Diviner Fu Xuan.
:::'''Ruoyue:''' Master Diviner Fu Xuan foresaw that she would remove me from the Divination Commission, so she did.
:::'''Ruoyue:''' How could someone make a decision based off something that hadn't happened yet? Anyway, I did leave the Commission, but the entire situation was a farce.
:::'''Ruoyue:''' Even if the Divination Commission didn't want me, I could still run my little old divination paraphernalia shop here. Outworlders who can't get their fortunes at the Commission could come to me instead.
::;(Return to previous option selection)
::{{Диалог|Разговор}} I've heard that your divinations aren't accurate?
:::'''Ruoyue:''' Of course they are accurate! Who told you that? Give me their name.
:::'''Ruoyue:''' ...Then again, they aren't totally wrong. Many times, the line between accuracy and inaccuracy is... subjective.
:::'''Ruoyue:''' Most people just want to know about their fortunes and have some sort of control over their future. In truth, everyone moves in a general direction in the great stream of destiny, but when it comes to actual good or ill luck...
:::'''Ruoyue:''' That's a hidden current of probability no one can ever fathom. To capture such an intricacy, you'd have to invest massive resources and rely on devices as huge as mountains to calculate that.
:::'''Ruoyue:''' So, one of the rules in the Divination Commission's "Three Don'ts" is "Don't divine personal matters." It's not particularly taboo or anything &mdash; just that there are too many variables and does more harm than good.
:::'''Ruoyue:''' But for me? I've got other ways. I provide clients with the most ambiguous results possible &mdash; it's about the limit of accuracy for my tiny shop anyway.
:::'''Ruoyue:''' For example, I don't even have to pinch my fingers to foretell that you will have a small amount of wealth coming in sometime between this week and this month. Am I right? Of course I am.
::;(Return to previous option selection)
::{{Диалог|Разговор}} I see a few game tables here as well?
:::'''Ruoyue:''' I do business. Divination makes money, and so do games of cards and tiles. There's no conflict of interest.
:::'''Ruoyue:''' I knew a girl called Qingque during my time at the Divination Commission. You'll run into her if you come here often. She recreated this game called "Celestial Jade" from old books.
:::'''Ruoyue:''' How nice it'd be to play a few rounds with friends. It lifts my spirits just seeing them play, too. If I could earn a living with a games parlor, I wouldn't be doing any divination.
::;(Return to previous option selection)
::{{Диалог|Выход}} I don't have any other questions.
:::'''Ruoyue:''' Come back again, esteemed customer. If you're down on your luck, I'll be here to help you turn it around.
;(If {{Mission|Obsequies Performed, A Long Road Ahead|showChapter=0}} has been completed and {{Mission|Wood Sprouts Anew, Fate Tilts Askew|showChapter=0}} has been completed, {{cx}}<!--performance 502013201 has been seen-->, and {{Mission|Obsequies Performed, A Long Road Ahead|showChapter=0}} has not been completed)
:{{Диалог|Выход}} I don't have any other questions.
::'''Ruoyue:''' Come back again, esteemed customer. If you're down on your luck, I'll be here to help you turn it around.

;(Talk to Shumiao)
;(First interaction)
::'''Shumiao:''' Martial arts and fitness! Come learn all about it!
::'''Shumiao:''' {{MC|ж=Miss|м=Mister}}, wanna learn about martial arts and fitness? Come take a look at our flyer, and I'll fill you in on all the details.
::{{Диалог|Стрелка}} No thanks, please keep it for someone else.
:::'''Shumiao:''' No worries, it's free anyway. I promise I'll make this really quick!
::{{Диалог|Стрелка}} Alright, I'll keep this and you tell me about it.
:::'''Shumiao:''' Awesome! I knew you'd be keen! I promise I'll make this really quick!
::'''Shumiao:''' I'm the coach at Exalting Sanctum's Tiger Boxing Gym, Shumiao. We're a custom boxing gym set up for Outworlders, and our coaches are the best on the Luofu with rich experience in immortality training. All our boxers are living out long lives and achieving incredible results.
::'''Shumiao:''' Our boss always says that he didn't open this gym to make money, but rather to let more interstellar travelers access the hyper-immortality way of life found aboard the Xianzhou Alliance.
::'''Shumiao:''' There's never been a better time to sign up as a member. Just sign up for ten years, and get another five years for free. That's a crazy deal! How about I help you register with us right now?
;(Subsequent interactions)
::'''Shumiao:''' Martial arts and fitness! Come learn all about it!
::'''Shumiao:''' Ah, there you are! Are you ready to sign up for a membership yet?
;(If {{Mission|Wood Sprouts Anew, Fate Tilts Askew|showChapter=0}} has been completed and {{cx}}<!--performance 502018202 has been seen-->)
:{{Диалог|Разговор}} Did you notice the Ambrosial Arbor was growing once again?
::'''Shumiao:''' How could I miss it &mdash; the thing's absolutely enormous!
::'''Shumiao:''' I was out on the streets promoting our gym when it happened, and I remember chatting with this old outworlder lady. I told her to train with us for a new lease on life, "just like a tree's regrowth"!
::'''Shumiao:''' She didn't really get what I meant, when suddenly: "Boing" &mdash; the whole Ambrosial Arbor had started actively growing. I pointed and told her, "See &mdash; just like a tree's regrowth"!
::'''Shumiao:''' ...But let's break it down into two parts. Everyone in Xianzhou knows that the Ambrosial Arbor's regrowth is definitely not a good thing. I hope my friends down at Scalegorge Waterscape are all doing okay.
;(If {{Mission|Back in Business (IV)|showChapter=0}} has been completed and {{Mission|Wood Sprouts Anew, Fate Tilts Askew|showChapter=0}} has been completed and {{cx}}<!--performance 502018202 has been seen-->)
:{{Диалог|Разговор}} Has business been going well lately?
::'''Shumiao:''' Because of you guys, the Aurum Alley has become so much more prosperous, and my business is doing better, too.
::'''Shumiao:''' Ironically, after the Ambrosial Arbor's growth, the Luofu became a more dangerous place. This situation made my boxing gym more popular than ever. After all, it's always best to know some moves that can help you defend yourself.
::'''Shumiao:''' Being out there in the world like you are, you're sure to bump heads with people from time to time... Why don't you drop by my boxing gym and have a session someday? I'll give you a discount!
::'''Shumiao:''' ...Hold on. It suddenly occurs to me that I have nothing to teach you... How about you give a lesson at my boxing gym? I'll offer you great pay!
;(If {{Mission|Back in Business (IV)|showChapter=0}} has been completed and {{Mission|Wood Sprouts Anew, Fate Tilts Askew|showChapter=0}} has been completed and {{cx}}<!--performance 502018202 has been seen-->)
:{{Диалог}} I'll mull it over.
::'''Shumiao:''' At this price, what are you waiting for? C'mon, {{MC|ж=Miss|м=Mister}}, what else would you like to know? Just ask!
::{{Диалог|Разговор}} Your boxing gym only accepts Outworlders?
:::'''Shumiao:''' I know what you're worried about, {{MC|ж=Miss|м=Mister}}! You're wondering, do these guys specialize in swindling Outworlders? I assure you that you're overthinking!
:::'''Shumiao:''' Xianzhou people get membership cards that last them over 200 years. There's absolutely no comparison to be made here. These discounts are intended for Outworlders visiting Xianzhou.
:::'''Shumiao:''' In other words, Xianzhou people who can live for centuries without training are not our target market. When you come to the Xianzhou Luofu, you can't leave empty-handed.
:::'''Shumiao:''' Come to our Tiger Boxing Gym for a few decades, and I guarantee you'll live much longer!
::;(Return to previous option selection)
::{{Диалог|Разговор}} Are you just planning on running away with my money?
:::'''Shumiao:''' A common misunderstanding. We're teamed up with the Cloud Knights, so we can't just run away from them.
:::'''Shumiao:''' People often question our business model, saying horrible things like, "You're only taking ten-year-long subscriptions because you're planning on running away with everything."
:::'''Shumiao:''' Lots of people throw in the towel and don't bother coming back after a few times. Rather than worrying about the boxing gym, they should be worrying about whether they've got the perseverance to see things through.
:::'''Shumiao:''' Our business model is designed to help gym-goers stick to the plan. Think about it &mdash; if you spend money without exercising, you'll feel like you're getting ripped off. And you'll come to the gym for training.
:::'''Shumiao:''' We sincerely hope that you can come and join us. Nobody wants to see you waste your money.
::;(Return to previous option selection)
::{{Диалог|Разговор}} Is it possible to live for several hundred years through training alone?
:::'''Shumiao:''' Sure! Think about it, why do the people aboard the Xianzhou ship live for so long?
:::{{Диалог|Стрелка}} Is it because they practice boxing?
::::'''Shumiao:''' That's right. Many Xianzhou people don't even realize the importance of boxing exercises.
::::'''Shumiao:''' I've met loads of lazy people aboard Xianzhou who neglect exercise and don't maintain a healthy attitude. They end up getting early-onset mara-struck sickness. So long as you keep up your daily practice, you can live for thousands of years more.
::::'''Shumiao:''' See, I told you exercising can lead to extreme longevity without getting fast and loose with any facts, right?
:::;(Return to previous option selection)
:::{{Диалог|Стрелка}} Isn't there a predetermining factor?
::::'''Shumiao:''' Your natural constitution is important, yes. But the way you're nurtured is far more important!
::::'''Shumiao:''' I've met loads of lazy people aboard Xianzhou who neglect exercise and don't maintain a healthy attitude. They end up getting early-onset mara-struck sickness. So long as you keep up your daily practice, you can live for thousands of years more.
::::'''Shumiao:''' See, I told you exercising can lead to extreme longevity without getting fast and loose with any facts, right?
:::;(Return to previous option selection)
::{{Диалог|Выход}} Forget about it. Maybe next time.
:::'''Shumiao:''' Okay! Take a look whenever you're interested, and I'll be waiting for you. But this body of yours will wait for nothing!
;(If {{Mission|Back in Business (IV)|showChapter=0}} has been completed and {{Mission|Wood Sprouts Anew, Fate Tilts Askew|showChapter=0}} has been completed and {{cx}}<!--performance 502018202 has been seen-->)
:{{Диалог|Выход}} Forget about it. Maybe next time.
::'''Shumiao:''' Okay! Take a look whenever you're interested, and I'll be waiting for you. But this body of yours will wait for nothing!

;(Talk to Xingxue)
;(First interaction)
::'''Xingxue:''' Why didn't he come by today?
::'''Xingxue:''' Unless... he's been transferred to another jurisdiction?
::{{Диалог|Стрелка}} Who are you waiting for?
:::'''Xingxue:''' An orderly from the Realm-Keeping Commission. We never should've even met, but for an ill-fated moment that brought us together.
:::'''Xingxue:''' ...But don't get the wrong idea. We don't have anything strange going on between us.
::{{Диалог|Стрелка}} Surely there's plenty more fish in the sea...
:::'''Xingxue:''' Why carry the torch...
:::'''Xingxue:''' Bah, what an absolute mess! There's nothing strange going on between that orderly and me, so don't get the wrong idea.
::'''Xingxue:''' It's just... I haven't had a chance to see him for a long time, and I can't help but feel a little bit lonely. Without him, my career, my entire future feels... empty.
::'''Xingxue:''' If things keep on like this, what's the point of me showing up to work again? But then again, if I don't show up, I'll be cut off from him entirely and I'm afraid I'll never get the chance to see him again...
::'''Xingxue:''' Ah! I'm so anxious...
;(Subsequent interactions)
::'''Xingxue:''' He... He hasn't shown up again today, either.
::'''Xingxue:''' I'm at my wit's end here!
:{{Диалог|Магазин}} What are you selling?
:{{Диалог}} I want to ask you something...
::'''Xingxue:''' Go ahead. It's just that I'm a little distracted with matters of the heart, so I might take a moment to answer...
::{{Диалог|Разговор}} What do you do for a living?
:::'''Xingxue:''' I'm just a lowly merchant who usually wanders the streets of Exalting Sanctum hawking my goods. Sometimes I'll sit down if I find a busy place and sell from there.
:::'''Xingxue:''' We're all self-employed in this line of work, and I don't make much at all &mdash; just enough to eat. There's no fixed daily income, and we're always squabbling with the Realm-Keeping Commission for this and that. It's a tough life.
:::{{Диалог|Возврат}} Why are you always squabbling with them about things?
::::'''Xingxue:''' You might not be aware of this &mdash; but you need a permit to sell goods in Exalting Sanctum. Not just anyone can do it.
::::'''Xingxue:''' Despite the Realm-Keeping Commission allowing traveling traders like us, they regulate us to specified places and don't let us venture beyond. And as for the place they assigned me...
::::'''Xingxue:''' Well, it's so deserted that I even have time to feed the pigeons. I have to take the initiative and run all over the place just to make a living.
::::'''Xingxue:''' Naturally, I can't let the Realm-Keeping Commission catch me while I'm doing this. Otherwise I'll be fined if I'm lucky, or could even lose my license... And then it'll be even harder to do business.
:::;(Return to previous option selection)
:::{{Диалог|Возврат}} Have you considered changing jobs?
::::'''Xingxue:''' Haha, everyone always asks me that. But you also have to understand that a job isn't something I have the luxury of changing.
::::'''Xingxue:''' The climate in the Xianzhou delves is great all year round, so there's no need to worry about the environment impacting business. But if you could find a stable and reliable job, then who'd want to risk doing this kind of work forever?
::::'''Xingxue:''' So it's not that I haven't thought about changing industry one day. I'm just not smart enough to be able to get a good job. That's why I'm a merchant.
::::'''Xingxue:''' But... After all these centuries, I actually think it's fun to be a merchant &mdash; matching wits against the Realm-Keeping Commission like this. Not just anyone that can do this job, y'know!
:::;(Return to previous option selection)
::{{Диалог|Разговор}} So what exactly is going on between you and him, then?
:::'''Xingxue:''' There's an old saying aboard Xianzhou, "A match in ability, is a match made in heaven"...
:::'''Xingxue:''' I've been pitting my wits and courage against this orderly for over 2 centuries, but we've never been able to determine who the winner is... Growing to appreciate one another is nothing short of inevitable.
:::{{Диалог|Стрелка}} So what's the name of this young orderly, then?
::::'''Xingxue:''' He... I think his name is Guangda.
::::'''Xingxue:''' Actually, he never used to work in this jurisdiction. He was transferred over for some reason about 200 years ago, and that's when our fates became entwined...
::::'''Xingxue:''' The first time I laid eyes on him, I knew that this was no ordinary orderly...
::::'''Xingxue:''' He really is one-of-a-kind... All the other orderlies basically turn a blind eye to me, but he's different...
::::'''Xingxue:''' He always looked so casual, as if he didn't care about his job in the slightest... Be that as it may, when he saw me he'd suddenly spare no effort in getting me back to the Realm-Keeping Commission...
::::'''Xingxue:''' I get it: He's a natural predator, a natural fighter! All of this inspired me to grow competitive &mdash; I vowed to Reignbow Arbiter that I would definitely be the winner in this little cat-and-mouse game of his!
::::'''Xingxue:''' I never thought this game would last for 200 years! We've been going at it the whole time, but we both enjoyed it &mdash; we both knew that we had a special connection with each other!
::::'''Xingxue:''' But it's a real pity... I haven't seen him the past few days. Where could he have gotten to? Don't tell me he found a better rival than me? I'm so sad...
:::;(Return to previous option selection)
:::{{Диалог|Стрелка}} Is it really just an appreciation for each other that you have?
::::'''Xingxue:''' Of course! What else could there be?
::::'''Xingxue:''' The first time I laid eyes on him, I knew that this was no ordinary orderly...
::::'''Xingxue:''' He really is one-of-a-kind... All the other orderlies basically turn a blind eye to me, but he's different...
::::'''Xingxue:''' He always looked so casual, as if he didn't care about his job in the slightest... Be that as it may, when he saw me he'd suddenly spare no effort in getting me back to the Realm-Keeping Commission...
::::'''Xingxue:''' I get it: He's a natural predator, a natural fighter! All of this inspired me to grow competitive &mdash; I vowed to Reignbow Arbiter that I would definitely be the winner in this little cat-and-mouse game of his!
::::'''Xingxue:''' I never thought this game would last for 200 years! We've been going at it the whole time, but we both enjoyed it &mdash; we both knew that we had a special connection with each other!
::::'''Xingxue:''' But it's a real pity... I haven't seen him the past few days. Where could he have gotten to? Don't tell me he found a better rival than me? I'm so sad...
:::;(Return to previous option selection)
::{{Диалог|Выход}} I don't have any more questions.
:::'''Xingxue:''' Guangda, o Guangda... When will we be able to duke it out once again...
