===Head to Starskiff Haven and find the Graceful Poet{{subst:void|<!--202090108-->}}===
{{Mission Description|type=adventure|location=Central Starskiff Haven|update|According to the Gloomy Poet's location, the Graceful Poet is currently in Starskiff Haven. Go and recover its Inspo Jade Abacus.<br />The Borderland Poet had a career guarding the frontier, so the Graceful Poets won't just randomly take action, right?<br />I don't think anyone can really understand this kind of thing.}}
{{Dialogue Start}}

;(Talk to Graceful Poet)
----
:'''Graceful Poet:''' I know why you're here, croak. But before we address that, please answer my question &mdash; what about writing poetry is of the most importance?
:'''Gloomy Poet:''' The most important thing about poetry... Surely it is depression?
:{{Диалог|Стрелка}} It's about subject and theme.
::'''Graceful Poet:''' Subject and theme alone without profundity, sentimentality, or the ingenuity of metaphor &mdash; without all that, it's just boring.
:{{Диалог|Стрелка}} It's about rhythm and style.
::'''Graceful Poet:''' Rhythm and style alone make for moronic wailing. Just a bunch of bad code, croak.
:{{Диалог|Стрелка}} It's about emotion and meaning.
::'''Graceful Poet:''' That's right &mdash; I can see that you have a deep understanding of poetry, croak!
:{{Диалог|Стрелка}} It's about the poet!
::'''Graceful Poet:''' Croak...You're not wrong. The poet's talent dictates the quality of a poem. But I asked you about writing poetry itself!
:'''Graceful Poet:''' Look, the most important thing about writing poetry is capturing those simple human emotions which resonate with everyone. And of all the simple human emotions, the pain of separation and the longing for eventual return is the most universal across all peoples.
:'''Graceful Poet:''' But, alas! Croak! I've been waiting all day here on this jetty but haven't managed to brew up the requisite emotions to compose a poem of departures.
:{{Диалог|Стрелка}} What do you mean by "poem of departures"?
::'''Graceful Poet:''' "'Tis hard to meet &mdash; and hard to say goodbye"... A poem that describes human emotion when parting from others is called a poem of departures.
:{{Диалог|Стрелка}} Poems aren't spaceships. Can it come just by waiting?
::'''Graceful Poet:''' "From wanderlust to sojourns afar, we all come home a visitor." If it doesn't even arrive at the departure jetty, then you won't be able to find it anywhere, croak.
:'''Graceful Poet:''' I curse the convenience of modern-day transport and communications aboard the Luofu. People depart yet don't have to worry about when they'll return. There's no earnest pleading, no heartfelt emotion, croak...
:'''Graceful Poet:''' The thought of how easy and satisfied goodbyes have become makes me want to stomp my feet in rage &mdash; even though I can't actually reach the ground.
:{{Диалог|Стрелка}} You just don't have the mindset that can see goodbyes.
::'''Graceful Poet:''' When you put it like that... can you, croak?
:{{Диалог|Стрелка}} Can't you just make do and write whatever?
::'''Graceful Poet:''' No way, croak! Poetry shan't ever just "make do."
::'''Graceful Poet:''' Have you read the doggerel that Master Cong writes? No emotion. You may as well just kill me.
:'''Graceful Poet:''' It's hopeless just waiting here. Please help me find what I'm looking for. There has to be an {{Цвет|Ключевой|nobold=1|emotional parting scene}} nearby.
:'''Graceful Poet:''' You know the tropes, {{Цвет|Ключевой|nobold=1|"the voyager saying farewell to his family," "the star-crossed lovers bidding goodbye," "parting friends"}}... that kind of thing. If you see anything, {{Цвет|Ключевой|nobold=1|please help me snap a photo.}}
:{{Диалог|Стрелка}} Alright, I'll help you snap a pic of a "parting scene."
::'''Graceful Poet:''' Thank you, croak.
:{{Диалог|Стрелка}} I want to bid you farewell right now to gift you an emotional departure.
::'''Graceful Poet:''' No. I don't have any emotions for you, croak. That's not enough material for a poem, croak!
:'''Graceful Poet:''' Don't worry. I just need to see that human emotion of parting, and the poem would write itself. Then I can give you my Inspo Jade Abacus, and you'll be done with your mission.
----
